Then, subtract 4 from both sides:

18x + 3 - 4 ≡ 0 mod p => 18x - 1 ≡ 0 mod p.

So, 18x ≡ 1 mod p. Therefore, the original equation simplifies to 18x ≡ 1 mod p. So, we need to find primes p for which this congruence has no solution in x.

